Fonts
-----
`logo-craft/assets/fonts.json` lists typefaces by name with their licence
family (SIL OFL, Apache 2.0, UFL, commercial). No font files are bundled.
`scripts/text_to_path.py` downloads Google Fonts files into the user's cache
under the licence each family carries, or uses fonts the user already has.
Whether a licence allows logo use is reported, not guaranteed; the user is
responsible for honouring the EULA of any font they ship.

Source material
---------------
The guidance is an original synthesis of publicly available writing by the
designers and researchers listed in `logo-craft/references/sources.md`. No
text is reproduced verbatim beyond short attributed phrases. Platform
specifications reflect the vendor pages on the date given in each file and
may since have changed; `logo-craft/.living/` tracks those changes.

Trademark clearance
-------------------
Nothing this skill produces has been searched against any trademark register.
A logo it designs may resemble an existing registered mark. Search USPTO,
EUIPO and WIPO (or ask counsel) before using a mark commercially.

